# sync_overflow.scn: schedule changes made with a Timer 0 overflow pending, for the harness's count drift report, shared by scenario_host and rt_test (pocketstation/tools/scenario.py).
# Author: suinevere
# In frame mode, with only the sound line enabled, each of 200 rounds times a slow sound of 2 samples, which ends about 17 Timer 0 periods on, then with interrupts masked reads the buttons 10 times, longer than that segment, so Timer 0 overflows untaken, and cancels the sound, whose rt_ev_sync meets the pending overflow; then it idles.
enable 0x2000
tick 1
repeat 200
sound 2 0
mask
repeat 10
log_buttons
end_repeat
sound_stop
unmask
idle 1
end_repeat
